    text: "2026-09-07 UTC correction: the full release:check passed using installed CLI/SDK 2026.9.7 and pm-changelog 2026.9.6. The coverage-suite report is 197 tests / 197 passed / 0 failed / 0 skipped. A separate later nested acceptance reports one test and is not the package suite total. Reported line/branch/function coverage: ℹ all files |  90.15 |    88.38 |   91.41 | . Complete four-dimensional all-source coverage and independent production/privacy/review gates remain open."
